csas-pohoda (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewritten from Python back to PHP (Ease based, like pohoda-raiffeisenbank)
  * The job always ends with a report, errors are logged to the console
  * Report is declared as a MultiFlexi artifact
  * Static debian/autoload.php, python3 dependency dropped
  * Optional upload of the ABO and PDF statements to SharePoint (Microsoft Graph)
    and attachment of the PDF link to the Pohoda bank records via Pohoda SQL
    (exit codes 3 and 4)

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200

csas-pohoda (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewritten statement_sync: configuration from the environment, date range
    or symbolic period, installed tools instead of hardcoded paths
  * Command csas-pohoda, exit codes 1 (download) and 2 (import failed)
  * New package multiflexi-csas-pohoda with the application definition
    (Csas and mServer credentials)
  * Depends on csas-statement-tools and pohoda-abo-importer

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:26:55 +0200
